07:26:32.530 --> 07:26:34.390
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Sinisimple ko lang po yung piercing the veil.

07:26:34.630 --> 07:26:35.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Opo, pero...

07:26:35.330 --> 07:26:35.650
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Opo yun po.

07:26:35.770 --> 07:26:36.450
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po kayo.

07:26:37.230 --> 07:26:46.970
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Pinapasimple ko pa nga po lalo. So, nakita nyo sa AMLC, nakita nyo sa bank records, may pumasok na pera, hindi na deklara sa EFS ng korporasyon, sa malamang pinaghatihan nila yan.

07:26:47.070 --> 07:26:47.510
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:26:48.160 --> 07:26:53.460
