07:27:06.720 --> 07:27:11.480
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Opo, pero kung walang dineklarang dividend, e di advance po siya against future dividend.

07:27:13.900 --> 07:27:14.500
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Hindi

07:27:14.500 --> 07:27:14.740
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: po ba?

07:27:15.760 --> 07:27:19.860
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Mahari pong advance against future dividend? Mahari po yan.

07:27:19.860 --> 07:27:20.380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You've

07:27:20.380 --> 07:27:20.660
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: been in the

07:27:20.660 --> 07:27:34.320
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: business for several decades, sir, Atty. Alex. I'm sure you know that that is a practice by most of the big corporations. They simply make an advance against future dividends because the tax will only be imposed once the dividend is declared.

07:27:35.300 --> 07:27:51.780
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Honorable Presiding Officer, kaya po... Kaya po, kung naninimbang sa aking sagot, totoo po na advance against future dividend po, pag nakarecord po sa financial statements at binibigay po sa stockholder po ng on record, ang kakaiba po dito ay hindi po ganun.

07:27:51.880 --> 07:28:01.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Pero dahil nga in-assume ninyo na, di ba, malamang pinaghati-hati yan, ang tamang pag-record nun ay advance on future dividend, kung nirecord

07:28:01.020 --> 07:28:02.840
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: nila. Sige po, kung nirecord po nila, opo.

07:28:03.000 --> 07:28:06.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: At kung ganun po, ano po yan, utang?

07:28:07.970 --> 07:28:09.270
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Utang po nila sa kumpanya.

07:28:10.290 --> 07:28:11.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Utang po nila sa kumpanya.

07:28:12.010 --> 07:28:12.570
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:28:12.670 --> 07:28:16.970
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So dapat po kung mag-a-appear man yun sa SALN, payable

07:28:16.970 --> 07:28:17.210
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: po.

07:28:17.690 --> 07:28:21.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Nasa liabilities.

07:28:22.010 --> 07:28:22.490
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Opo.

07:28:22.990 --> 07:28:24.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kung dineklara nila.

07:28:24.370 --> 07:28:25.050
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:28:25.310 --> 07:28:27.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Sa kasong ito, hindi rin po

07:28:27.070 --> 07:28:27.490
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: dineklara. Hindi po

07:28:27.490 --> 07:28:38.770
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: nakadeklara kasi po ginagamit po yung korporasyon para po makapagtago. Kaya po hindi po yung liability sa company. Kasi isusubi na po yun. Yun po yung tingin po doon.

07:28:39.870 --> 07:28:42.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Sa pananaw na po ninyo yun. Wala na po sa dokumento yun.

07:28:43.920 --> 07:28:44.520
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:28:44.620 --> 07:28:45.980
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yung parting isusubi.

07:28:47.500 --> 07:28:47.900
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Wala

07:28:47.900 --> 07:28:48.900
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: po sa dokumento yun.

07:28:48.980 --> 07:29:01.880
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Wala po sa dokumento. Subalit po, Honorable Presiding Officer, hindi po nating masabing utang nila sa kumpanya. Pag-pinierce na po yung will, sila na po yung kumpanya eh. Utang nila sa sarili nila.

07:29:02.870 --> 07:29:05.830
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Opo. Pero hindi rin nga dineklara sa SALN yun.

07:29:06.130 --> 07:29:10.520
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po. Wala pong declaration ng income, wala pong declaration ng...

07:29:10.520 --> 07:29:34.340
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: May natanong po sa inyo kanina to. Ako po ay nag-compute at gumamit ng calculator. Kung duda ako sa GenCorp, ang kabuang GenCorp sa parte ng 817,874,867 ay humigit kumulang 26% o 25.9% o katumbas ng 212,629,718. Kung hindi po ako kumpinsida sa inyo.

07:29:34.400 --> 07:29:34.900
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama

07:29:34.900 --> 07:29:35.100
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: po.

07:29:35.760 --> 07:29:50.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kung duda ako dun sa ginawa nyo sa Metro Chau at saka dun sa Cale88, ang kabuhan po noon ay 142,198,690 o 17.3% ng 817 million ninyong kabuhan.

07:29:51.300 --> 07:29:51.900
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: So

07:29:51.900 --> 07:30:15.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: pag tinanggal ko po yung dalawang yun may maiiwang pa rin 56.6% mula sa inyong calculation o yung base sa Sa bank accounts, sa insurance policies, ang may iwan po ay 463,046,459 na unexplained wealth base po sa computation niya. Tama po ba yan?

07:30:15.760 --> 07:30:17.480
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Kung wala po yung mga corporation po. Kung

07:30:17.480 --> 07:30:18.320
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: wala po yung mga corporation?

07:30:18.720 --> 07:30:18.920
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Apo.

07:30:19.460 --> 07:30:20.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Would that be correct?

07:30:20.280 --> 07:30:20.680
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:30:20.800 --> 07:30:50.420
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: And finally, Atty. Alex, you mentioned you've been conservative with respect to your estimates whether it's a percentage in the company. Whether it's an assumption you made, kung hindi po kayo conservative, kung ito po yung bare minimum, in your expertise and based on your review of the documents, ano po ba yung sukdulang hangganan? Kung ito po yung bare minimum nyo, ano po yung inyong maximum?

07:30:51.880 --> 07:31:43.620
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Based lang po sa mga documents po na nakita namin, hindi ko po sinama ang confidential funds po. So, 475 po yun. Yung discrepancy po namin sa AMLC, kung susundin po natin yung AMLC at hindi po kami conservative, 100 million po yun. Kung hindi po ako conservative sa GenCorp, 45% ang ginamit at i-apply nyo rin po yun dun po sa mga undeclared sales, ang impact po noon ay mga 250 million. So 350 million plus 450 million is 700 po. So parang halos magdodoble po yung amount po.

07:31:43.940 --> 07:31:50.960
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Can you be the one to compute for me, Attorney Alex, please? What would be the total of your ceiling if this is the minimum?

07:31:51.520 --> 07:31:53.160
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: 1.5 po.

07:31:53.840 --> 07:31:55.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: 1.5?

07:31:55.060 --> 07:31:55.180
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: 1

07:31:55.180 --> 07:31:56.300
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: .5 billion po.

07:31:57.180 --> 07:32:03.370
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ang unexplained... What would be the correct description of that sir? 1.5 ang total?

07:32:04.750 --> 07:32:09.360
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Mga less than 1.6 po yun. Mga 1.5 po.

07:32:09.360 --> 07:32:09.840
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: How

07:32:09.840 --> 07:32:11.240
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: would you describe that figure sir?

07:32:11.500 --> 07:32:30.040
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: That will be unexplained wealth po. Kasi po yung confidential funds po, kahit alam po natin ang pinanggalingan, so parang may explained po. Pero pag ang pinanggalingan po ay hindi po legal, Nagiging unexplained din po siya kahit alam niyo po kung saan ang galing.

07:32:30.300 --> 07:32:42.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I'll be more specific, sir. 1.5 billion will be the maximum estimate of the undeclared wealth of the respondent from 2022 to

07:32:42.620 --> 07:32:43.040
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: 2025

07:32:43.040 --> 07:32:46.400
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: without any double booking.

07:32:48.370 --> 07:32:52.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Magkakaiba pong amount sa kada taon pag sinuma total niyo, yun po yung magiging ceiling.

07:32:52.910 --> 07:32:53.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Would

07:32:53.350 --> 07:32:54.230
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: that be correct?

07:32:54.650 --> 07:32:55.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: And

07:32:55.250 --> 07:33:05.760
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: one final question, sir. Kung hindi po sila nagbayad ng buwis para dyan, hindi po ba dapat binawas nyo yung buwis na dapat bayar dahil hindi naman po kanila yun at dapat binayad sa gobyerno?

07:33:07.320 --> 07:33:09.360
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Pwede naman pong gawin po yun.

07:33:10.570 --> 07:33:14.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So babawas pa rin yun kung saka sakali dun sa total, whether the high or the low?

07:33:14.970 --> 07:33:26.410
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Opo, pero ang unexplained wealth po kasi, di po ba, ay yung total po nung wealth. Ngayon kung may payable po, babawas din po natin yun, kukumpitin po natin yung tax.

07:33:26.800 --> 07:33:28.660
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Babawas po yun at some point, hindi po ba? At

07:33:28.660 --> 07:33:29.140
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: some point po.

07:33:29.580 --> 07:33:36.240
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So whether it's the low of 817 or the high of 1.5, any liability would have to be subtracted or deducted from that?

07:33:36.460 --> 07:33:37.060
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Tama po.

07:33:38.480 --> 07:33:43.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you very much, Atty. Alex. The Senate President is recognized.

07:33:44.500 --> 07:34:07.290
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. President Officer. Merong follow-up question lang ako dito sa GN Corp. Atty. Alex. Dahil nabuksan ng ating President Officer, Ang sinasabi niyo dahil may lima silang outlet, dapat ang kanilang puhunan ay 175 million. Tama po ba?

07:34:07.390 --> 07:34:10.350
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Assuming po na 35 million po ang per

07:34:10.350 --> 07:34:10.730
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: outlet.

