07:54:50.250 --> 07:55:18.160
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We might just suspend today's trial for tomorrow given that it will be purely procedural matters although I hope I will be joined by my colleagues nevertheless for tomorrow's trial. So it's more for the court, Attorney Sheila. That's why as I said, we're taking it in advisement while we iron out some details to address those issues. Yes, Senator Judge Lacson.

07:55:19.820 --> 07:55:26.920
Sen. Panfilo “Ping” M. Lacson: Since we are anticipating, sir, na half day lang tayo, baka pwedeng after lunch na tayo mag-resume tomorrow? Pwede rin naman.

07:55:27.980 --> 07:55:29.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Pwede rin.

07:55:29.620 --> 07:55:31.760
